{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","狂狼袭咬"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","变身为狼，获得更强的作战能力。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","沙奎尔变身为“狼形态”并扑向1个地图格，击飞处于该格的敌军并对周围2格范围内的敌人造成190% ATK伤害，释放期间处于霸体状态。沙奎尔每秒需要消耗60点能量来维持“狼形态”。处于“狼形态”时，沙奎尔生成2格范围的“狂狼光环”，并且普通攻击会对面前1格扇形区域内的所有敌军造成伤害。处于“狂狼光环”内的友军受到的伤害降低20% + 2%，提升10 + 3点急速。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":163,"end":168,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":173,"end":177,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“狂狼光环”内的友军受到的伤害降低20% + 2%，提升15 + 3点急速。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“狂狼光环”内的友军受到的伤害降低25% + 2%，提升15 + 3点急速。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“狂狼光环”内的友军受到的伤害降低25% + 2%，提升20 + 3点急速。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“狂狼光环”内的友军受到的伤害降低25% + 2%，提升25 + 3点急速。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","烈爪锋刃"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","连续发动3次攻击，狼形态下能够造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","连续攻击目标3次，前2次攻击造成90% + 10% ATK伤害，第3次攻击造成160% + 20%伤害。处于“狼形态”时，技能范围变为前方1格扇形区域。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","第3次攻击造成180% + 20%伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","第3次攻击造成200% + 20%伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","第3次攻击造成220% + 20%伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","狼王战意"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升远程防御，变身为狼时额外提升生命汲取。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，沙奎尔获得25点远程防御。沙奎尔在“狼形态”时处于霸体状态，并获得30 + 5点生命汲取，且“狂狼光环”中每个非召唤物友军会使自己获得5% + 1%的攻击力加成。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":73,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","被动获得的生命汲取提升至40 + 5。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","被动获得的远程防御提升至30。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“狂狼光环”中每个非召唤物友军会使自己获得的攻击力加成提升至7.5% + 1%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","降低自身受到的伤害，当“狂狼光环”中非召唤物友军数量较多时获得额外提升。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到的伤害减少9%，且当“狂狼光环”范围中的非召唤物友军数量不少于2人时，受到的伤害额外减少4%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到的伤害减少12%，且当“狂狼光环”范围中的非召唤物友军数量不少于2人时，受到的伤害额外减少5%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到的伤害减少15%，且当“狂狼光环”范围中的非召唤物友军数量不少于2人时，受到的伤害额外减少7%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","战无不克"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","能够提前变身为狼。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","沙奎尔能量值超过700点时便可施放终极技能。沙奎尔在其每次施放终极技能之后的5秒内，维持“狼形态”不消耗能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","沙奎尔在其每次施放终极技能之后的7秒内，维持“狼形态”不消耗能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“狂狼光环”中每个非召唤物友军享受“狼王战意”中相同的攻击力加成。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","沙奎尔在其每次施放终极技能之后的8秒内，维持“狼形态”不消耗能量。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“烈爪锋刃”还能使目标降低受愈。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“烈爪锋刃”的第3次攻击还能在4秒使目标降低60点受愈。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","邦巴萨之刃"]]}